### Topic 32 - Request Handling & Responses (Product API)
### Start the app first: mvn spring-boot:run
### Look at the STATUS LINE and HEADERS of each response, not only the body!

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 1. List all products (see the X-Total-Count header)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Filter with query parameters (@RequestParam)
GET {{baseUrl}}?category=electronics&maxPrice=1000&sort=price

### 3. One product (@PathVariable) - note "stock", no "supplierCode", formatted dates
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 4. Unknown id -> 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/999

### 5. Create (@RequestBody + @RequestHeader) -> 201 Created + Location header
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: mobile-app

{
  "name": "USB-C Cable",
  "category": "electronics",
  "price": 199.00,
  "stock": 300
}

### 6. Replace ALL fields (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Big Java Mug",
  "category": "kitchen",
  "price": 349.00,
  "stock": 80
}

### 7. Change ONE field (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 299.00
}

### 8. Delete -> 204 No Content (send it twice: the second time gives 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/4

### 9. Read request headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/headers-demo
Accept-Language: hi-IN

### 10. Content negotiation: we only speak JSON -> 406 Not Acceptable
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/xml

### 11. A typo in the JSON ("prise") -> 400 Bad Request (fail-on-unknown-properties=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pen",
  "category": "office",
  "prise": 10,
  "stock": 5
}

### 12. CORS preflight as a browser would send it from http://localhost:5173
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
